### 登录
POST http://localhost:8002/api/short-link/admin/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 查询分组（替换 token）
GET http://localhost:8002/api/short-link/admin/v1/group
username: demo
token: REPLACE_ME

### 创建短链接（替换 token）
POST http://localhost:8002/api/short-link/admin/v1/create
Content-Type: application/json
username: demo
token: REPLACE_ME

{
  "domain": "localhost:8003",
  "originUrl": "https://www.example.com/",
  "gid": "demo-group",
  "createdType": 0,
  "validDateType": 0,
  "describe": "API example"
}
